cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CODA Data Washing Machine Comparator"
message: >-
  Cite this repository if you use the CODA/TahaComparator-CX comparator,
  benchmark tooling, cleaned code/data layout, Colab bundle, or documentation.
authors:
  - name: "Taha Mohammed"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MaTaha-ualr/DataWashingMachineClassic"
license-url: "https://github.com/MaTaha-ualr/DataWashingMachineClassic/blob/main/LICENSE"
date-released: "2026-03-30"
abstract: >-
  Clean research package for CODA (Context-Driven Adaptive Comparator), a
  data-adaptive comparator for the Data Washing Machine entity-resolution
  pipeline. CODA combines frequency-derived token roles, self-weighted evidence
  scoring, and ephemeral unresolved-pool context inside DWM's peel-off
  iteration model.
